- ctx C2 ≔ ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ᐅ j:ℕ
- ctx C3 ≔ ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ ih:plus[] Z m ≡ m ∈ ℕ
- ctx C4 ≔ ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ᐅ ih:plus[] k n ≡ plus[] n k ∈ ℕ
- ctx C5 ≔ ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ᐅ ih:plus[] (S n) k ≡ S (plus[] n k) ∈ ℕ
- ctx C6 ≔ C2 ᐅ ih:plus[] (plus[] n m) j ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m j) ∈ ℕ
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim n (k ih. (S ih)) m motive (k ih. ℕ)
- sig ε ⊦ plus ≔ λx. (λy. (ℕ-elim x (n ih. (S ih)) y)) : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ
- sig-var ε ᐅ n:ℕ ⊦ plus[]
- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ⊦ plusZeroId ≔ Refl : plus[] n Z ≡ n ∈ ℕ
- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ plusSucId ≔ Refl : plus[] n (S m) ≡ S (plus[] n m) ∈ ℕ
- el-reflect C3 ⊦ ih : (plus[] Z m ≡ m ∈ ℕ) reflect
- el-suc-cong C3 ⊦ S (plus[] Z m) ≐ S m
- ty-eq-cong C3 ⊦ S m ≡ S m ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] Z (S m) ≡ S m ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe C3 ⊦ Refl : S m ≡ S m ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] Z (S m) ≡ S m ∈ ℕ
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim Refl (m ih. Refl) n motive (m ih. plus[] Z m ≡ m ∈ ℕ)
- el-reflect ε ᐅ n:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim Refl (m ih. Refl) n : (plus[] Z n ≡ n ∈ ℕ) reflect
- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ⊦ zeroPlusId ≔ ℕ-elim Refl (m ih. Refl) n : plus[] Z n ≡ n ∈ ℕ
- el-pi-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ plus[] n k
- el-reflect C5 ⊦ ih : (plus[] (S n) k ≡ S (plus[] n k) ∈ ℕ) reflect
- el-suc-cong C5 ⊦ S (plus[] (S n) k) ≐ S (S (plus[] n k))
- ty-eq-cong C5 ⊦ S (S (plus[] n k)) ≡ S (S (plus[] n k)) ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] (S n) (S k) ≡ S (S (plus[] n k)) ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe C5 ⊦ Refl : S (S (plus[] n k)) ≡ S (S (plus[] n k)) ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] (S n) (S k) ≡ S (plus[] n (S k)) ∈ ℕ
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim Refl (k ih. Refl) m motive (k ih. plus[] (S n) k ≡ S (plus[] n k) ∈ ℕ)
- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ sucPlus ≔ ℕ-elim Refl (k ih. Refl) m : plus[] (S n) m ≡ S (plus[] n m) ∈ ℕ
- el-pi-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ plus[] Z n
- ty-eq-cong ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ plus[] Z n ≡ plus[] Z n ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] Z n ≡ plus[] n Z ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ Refl : plus[] Z n ≡ plus[] Z n ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] Z n ≡ plus[] n Z ∈ ℕ
- el-reflect C4 ⊦ ih : (plus[] k n ≡ plus[] n k ∈ ℕ) reflect
- el-suc-cong C4 ⊦ S (plus[] k n) ≐ S (plus[] n k)
- el-reflect C4 ⊦ sucPlus[k, n] : (plus[] (S k) n ≡ S (plus[] k n) ∈ ℕ) reflect
- el-eq-trans C4 ⊦ plus[] (S k) n ≐ S (plus[] n k) : ℕ via S (plus[] k n)
- ty-eq-cong C4 ⊦ plus[] n (S k) ≡ plus[] n (S k) ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] (S k) n ≡ plus[] n (S k) ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe C4 ⊦ Refl : plus[] n (S k) ≡ plus[] n (S k) ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] (S k) n ≡ plus[] n (S k) ∈ ℕ
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim Refl (k ih. Refl) m motive (k ih. plus[] k n ≡ plus[] n k ∈ ℕ)
- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ⊦ plusComm ≔ ℕ-elim Refl (k ih. Refl) m : plus[] m n ≡ plus[] n m ∈ ℕ
- el-pi-e C2 ⊦ plus[] n (plus[] m j)
- el-reflect C6 ⊦ ih : (plus[] (plus[] n m) j ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m j) ∈ ℕ) reflect
- el-suc-cong C6 ⊦ S (plus[] (plus[] n m) j) ≐ S (plus[] n (plus[] m j))
- ty-eq-cong C6 ⊦ S (plus[] n (plus[] m j)) ≡ S (plus[] n (plus[] m j)) ∈ ℕ ≐ plus[] (plus[] n m) (S j) ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m (S j)) ∈ ℕ
- el-ty-coe C6 ⊦ Refl : S (plus[] n (plus[] m j)) ≡ S (plus[] n (plus[] m j)) ∈ ℕ ↝ plus[] (plus[] n m) (S j) ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m (S j)) ∈ ℕ
- el-nat-e ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ ℕ-elim Refl (j ih. Refl) k motive (j ih. plus[] (plus[] n m) j ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m j) ∈ ℕ)
- sig ε ᐅ n:ℕ ᐅ m:ℕ ᐅ k:ℕ ⊦ plusAssoc ≔ ℕ-elim Refl (j ih. Refl) k : plus[] (plus[] n m) k ≡ plus[] n (plus[] m k) ∈ ℕ
- sig-var ε ⊦ plus[]
